{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t重陽節假期前的周末，昨日有超過135萬人次經各口岸出入境，當中約13萬人次使用經新皇崗口岸。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n保安局局長鄧炳強形容，口岸整體運作暢順，初時平均每日約有8萬人次使用，旅客平均5至15分鐘內完成過關。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n他又說，新皇崗口岸啟用後，羅湖及落馬洲支線口岸人流減少3至7%，認為起了分流作用。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T04:38:39.766892+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T04:21:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T04:37:34.895883+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T04:37:34.895883+00:00","content_hash":"d212cfc23adca963d97894b55cdf381239c27f02362da5791ac3ef9fba1332df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}